{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4b81ca96b242aa3a76970c2c2d49db4a70eed6caff1a1c02932259a273462bc7", "ja": "（今日は莉緒の野外ライブだった。紅葉舞うステージで\n華麗に歌い踊る莉緒の姿に、会場も盛り上がっていた）", "zh": "（今天是莉绪的户外演唱会。枫叶飘舞的舞台上，莉绪优雅地载歌载舞，现场气氛也十分热烈。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "6ef30baa7d661424bff284832c135b620344250f15fb639eaba7ea2859364a9c", "ja": "んん～……ふう。情熱的なステージだったわね。\n紅葉の舞う中、真っ赤な衣装で踊る私……素敵♪", "zh": "嗯～……呼。真是场充满热情的舞台表演呢。\n在漫天飞舞的红叶中，穿着鲜红服装跳舞的我……真迷人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3bc6bac10ba039081af64852881c7ea5b4223a2bbbb8c342a3e49b2da5713411", "ja": "紅葉も赤、衣装も赤で揃えたステージだから、\n見てるほうも気分が高揚するのかもしれないな？", "zh": "这是个红色的秋叶配红色服装的舞台，所以看的人或许也会跟着情绪高涨吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "34ff3d7ba9c3390eac5b929c878c314ea06ef1756429386715272b046603ae79", "ja": "紅に染まった私に、みんなドキドキしちゃったのね。\n良いお仕事ができて、私も大満足、ウフフ♪", "zh": "染上红色的我，让大家都心动不已了呢。能完成一份出色的工作，我也非常满足，嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a625ea84a57838955a8ee48e6f41b8f0feb9d96c1c603d951defb1eb637eef04", "ja": "ああ、今日はお疲れ様。\n帰ってゆっくり休んで……って、ちょっといいか？", "zh": "啊，今天辛苦了。\n回去好好休息……嗯，能稍微耽误你一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "928bfc60c40473353c7094d28c731ccd6cc421f8c2ad15b9b2a6ac32d0508754", "ja": "え、ど、どうしたのかしら、\n{$P$}くん？", "zh": "咦，你、你怎么了呀，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1006_p", "source_sha256": "70dfc36029be0743016432d46afee63c39423e62c631450a779db5a569224cff", "ja": "悪い。そのまま動かないでくれるか？", "zh": "抱歉，能请你保持不动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "74859dda493376190b9651f41dac9b9a368962f638c072e930667e6456fdadf1", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと{$P$}くんっ！？\nち、近くない？　どうしたの急に……", "zh": "等、等一下，{$P$}君！？\n太、太近了吧？突然怎么了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "ee0f5b55bfbc1b308f591e078de5c4eb75c93e174e297ed82cafdf1b1ec8dbc8", "ja": "そんな、いきなりなの！？\nわ、私、まだ心の準備が……！", "zh": "怎么、怎么突然这样啊！？\n我、我还没做好心理准备……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4065034bf0b833d0245341f7d726b1bc6ab66085c9e30bb59c021dfc325b2b23", "ja": "よし、取れた！　もういいぞ、莉緒。", "zh": "好，拿到了！已经可以了，莉绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "e24a9343b56093e5c759dc0414a48149529ae94f258d3ab3878211fa68a22339", "ja": "えっ？　えっ？　……い、今のは？", "zh": "诶？诶？……刚、刚才那是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0b678498bdef058bc611e730c87f1e8ebee9ca9b49cf5ec31043e03149b5b048", "ja": "ああ、悪い。莉緒の髪に枯れ葉がくっついてたんだ。\nさっきから気になってて……。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。莉绪的头发上粘了片枯叶。\n从刚才开始就一直很在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "fa0181bdb03b9d5ead3adc88354ae9fb5b2d5151f355100285ddb1685cdc7ff1", "ja": "ウソ～っ！？　ライブ中……それとも紅葉の絨毯に、\n寝ころんだ時に……って{$P$}くん！", "zh": "不会吧～！？是在演唱会的时候……还是躺在红叶铺成的地毯上时……等等，{$P$}君！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "c252c7e02f9fe4f2c2bc5f2324c51e3f3aca901847a42cd38dd12db39a8a9632", "ja": "そういうのは、取る前に言ってくれないと！\nビックリして……勘違いしちゃったじゃない……。", "zh": "这种事你得在拿之前说一声啊！\n吓了我一跳……害我误会了嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e0dfabc19d5b44e3f1e68605cefe401ab0ce17943bedcf3a4d2f9585e0b78a46", "ja": "あっ、そうだよな。すまない……。", "zh": "啊，对啊。对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "d651a10314ef06d040f3577983aec41d5eb799670a0cf2e2d644439a35d46579", "ja": "はぁ……今回は許してあげるから、次は気をつけてね？\nまだ心臓がドキドキしてる。もう……ふふっ♪", "zh": "哈啊……这次就原谅你了，下次可要注意哦？\n我的心脏还在怦怦直跳。真是的……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0383_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d57cfd5c6785bb69a129b8ebb91f03907335c8550982234b1b3caa4e55f2f676", "ja": "（その後も、しばらく莉緒の顔は真っ赤だった。\nそんなに驚かせてたとは……行動に気をつけないとな）", "zh": "（之后有一阵子，莉绪的脸还是通红的。没想到竟然把她吓成那样……以后得注意自己的行为了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
